      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POWER ROLEX (5) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (17.97) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Can bounce back. MY DINOSAUR (8) finished fifth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive a few runs back in his exceptional 17.16 win at this track over 300m. Must include on winning run three back. BACON (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 4 lengths at this track in a handy 17.57 beating She's A Angel. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Sure to be thereabouts. WHISKEY AGOGO (2) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
